-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Splash promos
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Official builds show at most one promo card per launch on the splash screen.
These promos are only for other apps from Lucid Systems LLC (currently
Chapternal). They make no tracking or network calls; the card is a plain link.
Promo images in assets/promos/ belong to those apps and are not licensed under
the AGPL or for use as marks. Forks and redistributions can turn promos off at
build time or at runtime (see packages/splash/README.md).

